voice model does, except it is a computer program that never gets tired. This model, called the audio

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:42.180
interaction AI, stays in one continuous stream. Every 0.4 seconds, it checks whether it should stay

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:47.420
quiet or start speaking, translating or even reacting to background sounds like a cough.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:52.180
